They are producing real boundary work.

18:57.520 --> 19:03.020
But the cost of separation, the sheer pressure exerted by the external environment, is simply too high.

19:03.020 --> 19:05.920
The fundamental equation of survival reverses.

19:06.220 --> 19:11.100
The cost of maintaining the boundary drastically exceeds the system's capacity to generate work.

19:11.320 --> 19:12.720
So this is the overwhelmed state.

19:12.820 --> 19:13.060
Right.

19:13.320 --> 19:19.440
Imagine a country with a flawless judiciary, zero internal corruption, a brilliant tax system,

